# Build context hygiene for the VPS server image (deploy/vps/Dockerfile).
#
# The image only compiles the cli/daemon crates from the root Rust
# workspace, so everything below is irrelevant to the build. Excluding it
# keeps the context transfer small and avoids shipping huge artifact trees
# (Rust `target/`, node_modules) into the daemon.
#
# IMPORTANT: do NOT exclude `crates/` or `apps/` — the build needs their workspace manifests
# and sources.
# Only the GUI's frontend directories under apps/gui-go/frontend are irrelevant here.

.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/target
dist
dist-ssr
docs-site
apps/gui-go/frontend/src
apps/gui-go/frontend/e2e
apps/gui-go/frontend/public
apps/gui-go/frontend/dist
assets
snap
coverage
.superset
.planning
.husky
*.log
